                new("What is the podcast episode mainly about?", ["How honeybees organise their work and share information", "How to become a beekeeper", "Why honey is good for your health", "The dangers of bee stings"], 0, "The host says \"they're far more organised than most offices\" and describes their jobs and the waggle dance."),
                new("What do young worker bees do?", ["Collect nectar and pollen", "Lay eggs", "Clean cells and feed the larvae", "Guard the entrance of the hive"], 2, "The host says, \"Young workers stay inside, cleaning cells and feeding the larvae.\""),
                new("What does the length of the waggle dance show?", ["The direction of the sun", "How far away the flowers are", "How many flowers there are", "Which bee found the flowers"], 1, "The host says \"the length of the dance tells the others how far away they are\"."),
                new("What will happen after the break?", ["The host will read a report on queen bees", "Listeners will take part in a quiz", "The host will talk about wasps", "The host will talk to a beekeeper"], 3, "The host says, \"After the break, we'll talk to a beekeeper about why bee numbers have been falling.\""),
