                new("Why are the trapped air bubbles so valuable?", ["They show how deep the ice is", "They are samples of the atmosphere from when the snow fell", "They contain ancient bacteria", "They make the ice easier to drill"], 1, "The lecturer says, \"Those bubbles are, in effect, samples of the atmosphere as it was when the snow fell.\""),
                new("What can dust in the ice suggest?", ["A distant volcanic eruption", "Very warm summers", "Periods when the climate was drier and windier", "Heavy snowfall"], 2, "The lecturer says, \"Dust suggests periods when the climate was drier and windier.\""),
                new("What does the lecturer say about interpreting the signals?", ["It is complex, and cores must be compared carefully", "It is simple and quick", "It can be done by computers alone", "It gives only very rough guesses"], 0, "The lecturer says, \"Interpreting these signals is complex, and different cores must be compared carefully.\""),
